msgstr "Pengaturan Galeri"

#: templates/admin/catalog/product/change_form.html:480
msgid "Regular Pricing"
msgstr "Harga Biasa"

#: templates/admin/catalog/product/change_form.html:538
msgid ""
"Configure how the bundle price is calculated. Choose 'Fixed Price' to use "
"the price field above, 'Percentage Discount' to discount component sum, or "
"'Sum of Components' to show total of all components."
msgstr ""
"Konfigurasikan cara harga bundel dihitung. Pilih 'Harga Tetap' untuk "
"menggunakan bidang harga di atas, 'Diskon Persentase' untuk mengurangi "
"jumlah komponen, atau 'Jumlah Komponen' untuk menampilkan total semua "
"komponen."

#: templates/admin/catalog/product/change_form.html:562
msgid "Sale Settings"
msgstr "Pengaturan Penjualan"

#: templates/admin/catalog/product/change_form.html:563
msgid ""
"Configure a sale discount for this product. The sale will automatically "
"activate/deactivate based on the dates you set."
msgstr ""
"Konfigurasikan diskon penjualan untuk produk ini. Penjualan akan secara "
"otomatis diaktifkan/dinonaktifkan berdasarkan tanggal yang Anda tetapkan."

#: templates/admin/catalog/product/change_form.html:625
msgid ""
"For Variable Products, inventory is managed in the Variations tab for each "
"variation."
msgstr ""
"Untuk Produk Variabel, persediaan dikelola di tab Variasi untuk setiap "
"variasi."

#: templates/admin/catalog/product/change_form.html:630
msgid ""
"Multi-warehouse mode is enabled. Stock levels for each warehouse are "
"configured in the 'Stock Items' inline section below after saving the "
"product."
msgstr ""
"Mode multi-gudang telah diaktifkan. Tingkat persediaan untuk setiap gudang "
"dikonfigurasikan dalam bagian 'Item Persediaan' di bawah setelah menyimpan "
"produk."

#: templates/admin/catalog/product/change_form.html:635
msgid ""
"Simplified stock management mode. Enter the total stock quantity below. To "
"enable multi-warehouse inventory tracking, go to Store Settings > Inventory."
msgstr ""
"Mode manajemen persediaan disederhanakan. Masukkan jumlah persediaan total "
"di bawah. Untuk mengaktifkan pelacakan inventaris multi-gudang, pergi ke "
"Pengaturan Toko > Persediaan."

#: templates/admin/catalog/product/change_form.html:659
msgid "Stock Quantity"
msgstr "Jumlah Stok"

#: templates/admin/catalog/product/change_form.html:667
msgid "Total quantity available for this product in your main warehouse"
msgstr "Jumlah total yang tersedia untuk produk ini di gudang utama Anda"

#: templates/admin/catalog/product/change_form.html:685
msgid "Current Stock Status"
msgstr "Status Stok Saat Ini"

#: templates/admin/catalog/product/change_form.html:689
msgid "units in stock"
msgstr "unit dalam stok"

#: templates/admin/catalog/product/change_form.html:743
msgid ""
"Standard product codes used for marketplace listings, inventory systems, and"
" point-of-sale. These help customers find your products across different "
"platforms."
msgstr ""
"Kode produk standar yang digunakan untuk daftar pasar, sistem inventaris, "
"dan titik penjualan. Kode ini membantu pelanggan menemukan produk Anda di "
"berbagai platform."

#: templates/admin/catalog/product/change_form.html:820
msgid ""
"Required for international shipments. Products without this data cannot be "
"shipped outside the origin country."
msgstr ""
"Diperlukan untuk pengiriman internasional. Produk tanpa data ini tidak dapat"
" dikirim keluar dari negara asal."

#: templates/admin/catalog/product/change_form.html:822
msgid "Look up HS codes"
msgstr "Cari Kode HS"

#: templates/admin/catalog/product/change_form.html:896
msgid "Search Engine Optimization"
msgstr "Optimasi Mesin Pencari"

#: templates/admin/catalog/product/change_form.html:899
msgid ""
"Optimize how your product appears in search engine results. The preview "
"below shows how it will look in Google search. Click the globe icon to "
"translate into other languages."
msgstr ""
"Optimalkan cara produk Anda muncul dalam hasil mesin pencari. Preview di "
"bawah menunjukkan bagaimana tampilannya di pencarian Google. Klik ikon globe"
" untuk menerjemahkan ke bahasa lain."

#: templates/admin/catalog/product/change_form.html:936
msgid "Search Result Preview"
msgstr "Pratinjau Hasil Pencarian"

#: templates/admin/catalog/product/change_form.html:942
msgid ""
"This is a preview only. Actual search engines may vary the layout and "
"content based on their algorithms and display preferences."
msgstr ""
"Ini hanya tampilan pratinjau. Mesin pencari aktual mungkin memvariasikan "
"tata letak dan konten berdasarkan algoritma dan preferensi tampilan mereka."

