msgstr "Editor Desain Visual"

#: templates/admin/catalog/product/change_form.html:1491
msgid ""
"Set up a visual canvas editor where customers can add text, images, and "
"clipart to your product. Define designable surfaces, upload mockup images, "
"create design templates, and configure pricing."
msgstr ""
"Buat editor kanvas visual di mana pelanggan dapat menambahkan teks, gambar, "
"dan clipart ke produk Anda. Definisikan permukaan yang dapat didesain, "
"unggah gambar mockup, buat template desain, dan konfigurasikan harga."

#: templates/admin/catalog/product/change_form.html:1499
msgid "Design Editor Configured"
msgstr "Editor Desain Terkonfigurasi"

#: templates/admin/catalog/product/change_form.html:1501
msgid ""
"This product has a visual design editor. Open the setup page to manage "
"surfaces, templates, and settings."
msgstr ""
"Produk ini memiliki editor desain visual. Buka halaman pengaturan untuk "
"mengelola permukaan, template, dan pengaturan."

#: templates/admin/catalog/product/change_form.html:1509
msgid "No Design Editor"
msgstr "Tidak Ada Editor Desain"

#: templates/admin/catalog/product/change_form.html:1511
msgid ""
"Open the Design Editor Setup to configure surfaces and enable the visual "
"customization experience."
msgstr ""
"Buka pengaturan Editor Desain untuk mengonfigurasi permukaan dan "
"mengaktifkan pengalaman penyesuaian visual."

#: templates/admin/catalog/product/change_form.html:1517
msgid "Open Design Editor Setup"
msgstr "Buka Pengaturan Editor Desain"

#: templates/admin/catalog/product/change_form.html:1523
msgid ""
"Save this product first, then come back to set up the visual design editor."
msgstr ""
"Simpan produk ini terlebih dahulu, kemudian kembali untuk mengatur editor "
"desain visual."

#: templates/admin/catalog/product/change_form.html:1600
msgid "Configurator Pricing"
msgstr "Harga Konfigurasi"

#: templates/admin/catalog/product/change_form.html:1604
msgid "Choose how the price is calculated for configured products."
msgstr "Pilih cara harga dihitung untuk produk yang dikonfigurasikan."

#: templates/admin/catalog/product/change_form.html:1638
#: templates/admin/catalog/product/change_form.html:1696
msgid "Add Slot"
msgstr "Tambahkan Slot"

#: templates/admin/catalog/product/change_form.html:1644
msgid "Loading slots..."
msgstr "Memuat slot..."

#: templates/admin/catalog/product/change_form.html:1657
msgid ""
"Define which options are compatible across slots. Use the compatibility "
"matrix to manage rules visually."
msgstr ""
"Tentukan opsi mana yang kompatibel di antara slot. Gunakan matriks "
"kompatibilitas untuk mengelola aturan secara visual."

#: templates/admin/catalog/product/change_form.html:1662
msgid "rules defined"
msgstr "aturan yang didefinisikan"

#: templates/admin/catalog/product/change_form.html:1666
msgid "Open Compatibility Matrix"
msgstr "Buka Matriks Kompatibilitas"

#: templates/admin/catalog/product/change_form.html:1681
#: templates/admin/catalog/product/change_form.html:1718
msgid "Add Preset"
msgstr "Tambahkan Preset"

#: templates/admin/catalog/product/change_form.html:1687
msgid "Loading presets..."
msgstr "Memuat preset..."

#: templates/admin/catalog/product/change_form.html:1708
msgid "Save Slot"
msgstr "Simpan Slot"

#: templates/admin/catalog/product/change_form.html:1730
msgid "Save Preset"
msgstr "Simpan Preset"

#: templates/admin/catalog/product/change_form.html:1741
#: templates/admin/catalog/product/change_form.html:1980
msgid "Save Product First"
msgstr "Simpan Produk Terlebih Dahulu"

#: templates/admin/catalog/product/change_form.html:1742
msgid ""
"Save this product as a configurable product to start adding configuration "
"slots, options, compatibility rules, and presets."
msgstr ""
"Simpan produk ini sebagai produk konfigurasi untuk memulai menambahkan slot "
"konfigurasi, opsi, aturan kompatibilitas, dan pengaturan awal."

#: templates/admin/catalog/product/change_form.html:1753
msgid "3D Product Visualization"
msgstr "Visualisasi Produk 3D"

#: templates/admin/catalog/product/change_form.html:1757
msgid ""
"Add a 3D model to this configurable product. Customers will see the model "
"update in real-time as they select options. Use the 3D Scene Manager to "
"upload a GLB model, map configurator options to visual changes, and "
"configure viewer settings."
msgstr ""
"Tambahkan model 3D ke produk konfigurasi ini. Pelanggan akan melihat model "
"diperbarui secara real-time saat mereka memilih opsi. Gunakan 3D Scene "
"Manager untuk mengunggah model GLB, memetakan opsi konfigurasi ke perubahan "
"visual, dan mengonfigurasi pengaturan tampilan."

#: templates/admin/catalog/product/change_form.html:1765
msgid "3D Scene Configured"
msgstr "Skenario 3D Terkonfigurasi"

#: templates/admin/catalog/product/change_form.html:1767
msgid "This product has a 3D scene. Open the Scene Manager to edit it."
msgstr "Produk ini memiliki adegan 3D. Buka Manajer Adegan untuk mengeditnya."

#: templates/admin/catalog/product/change_form.html:1775
msgid "No 3D Scene"
msgstr "Tidak Ada Skenario 3D"

#: templates/admin/catalog/product/change_form.html:1777
msgid "Open the Scene Manager to set up a 3D model for this product."
msgstr "Buka Manajer Adegan untuk mengatur model 3D untuk produk ini."

#: templates/admin/catalog/product/change_form.html:1783
msgid "Open 3D Scene Manager"
msgstr "Buka Manajer Skenario 3D"

#: templates/admin/catalog/product/change_form.html:1789
msgid "Save this product first, then come back to set up 3D visualization."
msgstr ""
"Simpan produk ini terlebih dahulu, lalu kembali untuk mengatur visualisasi "
"3D."

#: templates/admin/catalog/product/change_form.html:1807
msgid ""
"Configure booking type, duration, scheduling, confirmation, and display "
"settings."
msgstr ""
"Konfigurasikan jenis pemesanan, durasi, jadwal, konfirmasi, dan pengaturan "
"tampilan."

#: templates/admin/catalog/product/change_form.html:1811
msgid "Loading configuration..."
msgstr "Memuat konfigurasi..."

